    <header>
        <relations>
            <rel name="background" type="rst"/>
            <rel name="circumstance" type="rst"/>
            <rel name="concession" type="rst"/>
            <rel name="elaboration" type="rst"/>
        </relations>
    </header>
    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="12" relname="span">Microsoft just introduced an interesting error recovery feature for Windows XP.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="18" relname="circumstance">Previously, when XP encountered a system error or serious application error</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="18" relname="span">it would pop up a dialog box asking the user if he/she would like report the error to Microsoft.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="3" relname="elaboration">If you clicked on "Yes" it would prepare and send an error report to Microsoft over the Internet.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="13" relname="span">Microsoft has now introduced an OS patch that finds any material related to the error and displays it for the user.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="15" relname="span">To quote the Microsoft website:</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="6" relname="elaboration">This update will enable you to automatically view responses to Windows error reports. After submitting an error report, if information relating to the crash event is available such as a fix, workaround, or other information, then the response may be viewed immediately and automatically. The patch is available for download at: http://www.microsoft.com/downloads/details.aspx?FamilyID=a1c6c3d8-5053-436e-b898-9cd995292baa&amp;DisplayLang=en</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="14" relname="span">It doesn't respond for all errors reported</segment>
        <segment id="9" parent="8" relname="elaboration">(I may just have unique errors),</segment>
        <segment id="10" parent="16" relname="span">but occasionally it returns useful information.</segment>
        <group id="11" type="span"/>
        <group id="12" type="span" parent="11" relname="span"/>
        <group id="13" type="span" parent="19" relname="span"/>
        <group id="14" type="span" parent="10" relname="concession"/>
        <group id="15" type="span" parent="5" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="16" type="span" parent="13" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="17" type="span" parent="1" relname="background"/>
        <group id="18" type="span" parent="17" relname="span"/>
        <group id="19" type="span" parent="12" relname="elaboration"/>
    </body>
</rst>
